  "Description": "Demultiplexing and filtering utilities intended for reads\nwith combinatorial barcodes (i.e. PETRI-seq and SPLiT-seq). The\ndemultiplexer algorithm uses the position of the segments to\nextract and compare the barcodes with the reference\n(whitelist). A Shiny application is provided to interactively\nselect cutoffs for which barcode combinations to keep.",
